## Why This Is Asked
This tests cross‑account PrivateLink design, per‑tenant isolation, and short‑lived credentials.

## Key Concepts
- PrivateLink interface endpoints across accounts
- API Gateway + Lambda authorizer with TTL tokens
- Cross‑account IAM trust and per‑tenant roles
- Secrets rotation and revocation latency
- Observability and test strategy

## Code Example
```javascript
// Lambda authorizer skeleton (high level)
exports.handler = async (event) => {
